  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest restaurant in the direction from Spella Park, Algonquin, IL to Legoland Discovery Center Chicago, Schaumburg, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.351252 42.161567)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.034026 42.039672)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.351252 42.161567)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.351252 42.161567)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
